# Almost everything in this project lives in the repo — census tables, historical
# extracts, and DERIVED genetic tables (allele freqs, admixture, haplogroup counts)
# are all small and committed normally.
#
# The ONLY things kept out are raw genomic dumps that GitHub physically can't hold
# (100MB/file limit), and secrets. For raw genomes we commit a citation + download
# pointer in CITATIONS.md instead of the file itself.

# Raw, oversized bioinformatics formats (keep a citation pointer instead)
*.vcf
*.vcf.gz
*.bcf
*.bam
*.cram
*.fastq
*.fastq.gz
data/**/raw/

# Secrets (e.g. Census API key)
.env

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
